<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<task id="040" project="visual-host-create-button-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>CreateKPIAssessmentWizard + kpiAssessmentService (no files step)</title>
    <phase>C: CreateKPIAssessmentWizard</phase>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <estimated-hours>4</estimated-hours>
    <dependencies>021</dependencies>
    <blocks>050</blocks>
    <tags>shared-lib, wizard, adr-024, frontend</tags>
    <rigor-hint>FULL</rigor-hint>
    <rigor-reason>New wizard + service creating sprk_kpiassessment</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Single-component wizard following the canonical reference; simpler (no files/prefill)</model-tier-reason>
    <parallel-group>E</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Build CreateKPIAssessmentWizard (wrapping CreateRecordWizard) + kpiAssessmentService, following the canonical workAssignmentService.ts. Steps: Associate To → Enter Info → Next Steps (NO Add Files step — KPI needs no documents). Associate via applyResolverFields (Matter + Project); cards Send Email / Add To Do / Assign Work; wire the kpi-assessment registry key.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE shared-UI developer + ADR-024. Copy the canonical service pattern.</role>
  <goal>"+" on a KPI-bound visual creates a valid sprk_kpiassessment regarding the host Matter/Project via applyResolverFields; Enter Info collects the owner manifest fields; NO files step, NO prefill.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>design §5.4/§5.6; FR-05/10/16. KPI is resolver-ready (owner-created resolver fields). Manifest: sprk_kpiname, sprk_performancearea (choice), sprk_kpigradescore (choice), sprk_assessmentcriteria, sprk_assessmentnotes. CreateRecordWizard makes the Add-files step conditional — omit it for KPI (config, not a fork).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateKPIAssessmentWizard/ (new)
      src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateWorkAssignmentWizard/workAssignmentService.ts (CANONICAL)
      src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/WizardRegistry/wizardRegistry.ts
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      projects/visual-host-create-button-r1/spec.md
      projects/visual-host-create-button-r1/design.md
      projects/visual-host-create-button-r1/notes/field-manifests/kpi.md
      src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateWorkAssignmentWizard/workAssignmentService.ts
      src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/services/PolymorphicResolverService.ts
      .claude/adr/ADR-024-polymorphic-resolver-pattern.md
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <steps>
    <step>Create kpiAssessmentService.createKpiAssessment mirroring workAssignmentService (nav-prop discovery → payload from manifest → BU defaults → applyResolverFields Matter/Project → createRecord('sprk_kpiassessment') → warnings). No file pipeline.</step>
    <step>Create CreateKPIAssessmentWizard wrapping CreateRecordWizard with the Add-files step omitted; CreateKpiAssessmentStep (Enter Info, choice fields from option-sets); Next Steps cards via WizardFollowOns.</step>
    <step>Wire wizardRegistry 'kpi-assessment' → CreateKPIAssessmentWizard.</step>
    <step>Unit tests per ADR-038.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>Read, Grep, Edit, Write, Skill(adr-check), Skill(code-review)</tools>
  <outputs>components/CreateKPIAssessmentWizard/ + registry entry + tests.</outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion>Submitting creates a valid sprk_kpiassessment regarding the host Matter/Project with all resolver fields.</criterion>
    <criterion>Wizard shows Associate To → Enter Info → Next Steps (NO Add Files).</criterion>
    <criterion>Choice fields populate from Dataverse option-sets; adr-check clean.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <ui-tests>
    <test name="KPI create from host visual">
      <steps><step>Open a KPI-bound visual on a Matter/Project</step><step>Click "+"; verify no Add Files step; complete; submit</step><step>Inspect the KPI regarding + resolver fields</step></steps>
      <expected>Valid sprk_kpiassessment regarding the host; no files step; no console errors</expected>
    </test>
  </ui-tests>
</task>
